{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 30, "timestamp": 1794685775, "env": {"TERM": null}, "title": "SGO: offline tour and user-defined metrics"}
[0.016275, "o", "OFFLINE SYNTHETIC DEMO | No platform connections or API execution\r\n"]
[0.01753, "o", "Source: d38225f067a06c7c22d4a88757dec0db4a256d24\r\nPython 3.12.3\r\nA difference is arithmetic. An explanation needs evidence.\r\n"]
[3.017725, "o", "\r\n$ sgo tour\r\n"]
[4.110061, "o", "SALESFORCE-GOVERNED ONTOLOGY | OFFLINE SYNTHETIC TOUR\r\n"]
[4.360234, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.610364, "o", "1. Which revenue? [ambiguity]\r\n"]
[4.860517, "o", "   Clarify the metric before choosing a source.\r\n"]
[5.110672, "o", "   Outcome: clarification_required\r\n"]
[5.360832, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.611017, "o", "2. An approved definition [approved-read]\r\n"]
[5.861184, "o", "   Return a read plan, never execute an API.\r\n"]
[6.111344, "o", "   Outcome: read_plan_only\r\n"]
[6.361465, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.611622, "o", "3. A missing fixture scope [denied]\r\n"]
[6.861808, "o", "   Stop before returning semantic context.\r\n"]
[7.112029, "o", "   Outcome: denied\r\n"]
[7.362145, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.612287, "o", "4. An expired definition [expired]\r\n"]
[7.862429, "o", "   A previously approved definition is not valid forever.\r\n"]
[8.112587, "o", "   Outcome: definition_unavailable\r\n"]
[8.362752, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.612967, "o", "5. The wrong source [binding-mismatch]\r\n"]
[8.863152, "o", "   An allowlisted API is insufficient if it is bound to the wrong metric.\r\n"]
[9.113369, "o", "   Outcome: binding_mismatch\r\n"]
[9.36351, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.613712, "o", "6. Arithmetic is not causality [difference-only]\r\n"]
[9.863924, "o", "   Without a bridge, report only the difference.\r\n"]
[10.114103, "o", "   Outcome: difference_only\r\n"]
[10.364256, "o", "   Synthetic USD difference: 300,000.00\r\n"]
[10.614395, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.864607, "o", "7. An evidence-backed explanation [explained]\r\n"]
[11.114766, "o", "   A matching synthetic bridge supplies the explanation.\r\n"]
[11.364889, "o", "   Outcome: explained_by_fixture_bridge\r\n"]
[11.615066, "o", "   Synthetic USD difference: 300,000.00\r\n"]
[11.865259, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.115477, "o", "8. Apples and oranges [incompatible]\r\n"]
[12.3656, "o", "   Do not reconcile different currencies or cohorts.\r\n"]
[12.615822, "o", "   Outcome: incompatible_dimensions\r\n"]
[12.865987, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.116118, "o", "No live vendor integration, authenticated authorization, or API execution.\r\n"]
[13.366274, "o", "[exit 0]\r\n"]
[17.366429, "o", "\r\n$ sgo byod examples/user-metrics.json\r\n"]
